        {
          "text": " Neitoki Belshasa aitanapisho neishopokini Daniel olkila sintet o lpisiai le sahabu oitamanaki emurt enye, nelimuni aaibalunye naaipirta ninye, nchere keaku ninye o liokuni oitoreisho te nkitoria.",
          "type": "text",
